OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,7,     Fafternoon of great music including
OL,8,     Fperformances from the Berlin Radio
OL,9,     FSymphony Orchestra and chamber
OL,10,     Fmusic from across Bavaria.
OL,11,G1600 Composer of the Week: The Mighty
OL,12,G     Handful
OL,13,     F2/5. Donald Macleod looks at the
OL,14,     Ftensions within the group of 'The
OL,15,     FFive' composers and their circle,
OL,16,     Fas Rimsky Korsakov and Borodin
OL,17,     Fjoin the fray.
OL,18,G1700 In Tune
OL,19,     FLive music and interviews from the
OL,20,     Fworld's finest classical
OL,21,     Fmusicians.
